      "writtenOn": "2020-09-22T19:47:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree that disable_int isn\u0027t a great name since it is confusing with the existing disable_interrupt.\n\nget_int_mask does not imply that interrupt will be disabled. I would not expect interrupts to be disabled when calling get_ function. get_ function normally do not mutate the state of the system. We need a difference name other than get_int_mask if we are going to disable interrupts in the function",
